  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "AI Input Enhancer",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | [English](README.en.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/zhengzeyong9527-droid/ai-input-enhancer/releases/latest)\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin#ui-enhancements)\n\nDeepSeek Harness（DSH）的提示词优化插件。插件在对话输入框增加“提示词优化”操作：优化完成后直接将结果填入输入框，并允许你随时撤回到原始提示词。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 三种明确的优化模式：保真优化、开发化表达、规格扩展。\n- 优化中可取消，并显示加载状态。\n- 优化结果直接填入对话框，可一键撤回原始提示词。\n- 可选的会话内短期记忆：最多保留最近三轮已应用的优化结果。\n- 可选的当前会话上下文，并可设置字符预算。\n- 可选的工作区 Markdown 文档上下文，仅限当前会话的工作区根目录。\n- 可配置主模型、回退模型、超时和最大输出 token。\n- 不存储 API Key。"
    },
    {
      "section": "界面",
      "text": "**输入框入口**\n\n<img src=\"assets/screenshots/composer-action.png\" alt=\"提示词优化操作入口\" width=\"520\">\n\n**高级设置**\n\n高级设置按优化策略、会话上下文、工作区文档上下文和模型限制分段展示，避免长说明和输入项交错。\n\n<img src=\"assets/screenshots/advanced-settings.png\" alt=\"高级设置\" width=\"520\">\n\n**模型与执行限制**\n\n<img src=\"assets/screenshots/model-limits.png\" alt=\"模型与执行限制\" width=\"520\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "优化模式",
      "text": "- **保真优化**：提升表达清晰度，但不虚构需求、事实、架构或范围。\n- **开发化表达**：将用户已经提供的开发信息整理成更适合实现的表述，不替你选择技术栈或设计方案。\n- **规格扩展**：允许补充必要默认项，但必须在 `## Default assumptions` 下明确标示，供你审阅。"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私与上下文",
      "text": "当前草稿会发送给你选择的 DSH 模型路由。所有额外上下文默认关闭。\n\n启用会话上下文后，插件只读取当前会话 Surface 中的 `user/message` 和 `assistant/message` 文本。启用工作区上下文后，插件最多读取当前会话工作区根目录内三个相关 Markdown 文件。两个来源都各自受字符预算限制；服务不可用或读取失败时会自动降级为无该来源上下文。插件不会持久化完整草稿、会话历史或文档内容。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "将已发布的 npm 包安装到 Web profile：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add zzy-dsh-prompt-optimizer\n```\n\n重启现有 DSH Web 进程并刷新当前 URL。"
    },
    {
      "section": "评估",
      "text": "可复现的 30 条盲化 A/B 测试协议、脱敏输入和独立评估结果见 [tests/evaluation/report.md](tests/evaluation/report.md) 与 [tests/evaluation/conclusion.md](tests/evaluation/conclusion.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "AI Input Enhancer",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | [English](README.en.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/zhengzeyong9527-droid/ai-input-enhancer/releases/latest)\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin#ui-enhancements)\n\nA prompt optimizer for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). It adds a prompt-optimization action to the composer, writes successful results directly into the draft, and lets you undo back to the original prompt."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Explicit faithful, developer, and specification modes.\n- Visible loading state with cancellation while optimizing.\n- Direct draft replacement with one-click undo to the original prompt.\n- Optional session-local memory of the three most recently applied optimizations.\n- Optional budgeted current-conversation context.\n- Optional budgeted Markdown context from the current session workspace root.\n- Primary and fallback model routes, timeout, and output-token controls.\n- No API keys are stored by the plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "Interface",
      "text": "**Composer action**\n\n<img src=\"assets/screenshots/composer-action.png\" alt=\"Prompt optimization action\" width=\"520\">\n\n**Advanced settings**\n\nAdvanced settings are grouped into optimization strategy, conversation context, workspace document context, and model limits so long explanations and inputs stay readable.\n\n<img src=\"assets/screenshots/advanced-settings.png\" alt=\"Advanced settings\" width=\"520\">\n\n**Model and execution limits**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Interface",
      "text": "<img src=\"assets/screenshots/model-limits.png\" alt=\"Model and execution limits\" width=\"520\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Modes",
      "text": "- **Faithful** improves clarity without inventing requirements, facts, architecture, or scope.\n- **Developer** structures user-provided engineering facts without selecting a stack or design.\n- **Specification** may add needed defaults, but labels them under `## Default assumptions` for review."
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy and Context",
      "text": "The draft is sent to the DSH model route chosen by the user. Extra context is disabled by default.\n\nConversation context reads only current `user/message` and `assistant/message` text. Workspace context reads at most three relevant Markdown files directly inside the current session workspace root. Both sources are independently budgeted and gracefully degrade when unavailable. Full drafts, session history, and document contents are not persisted."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add zzy-dsh-prompt-optimizer\n```\n\nRestart the existing DSH Web process and refresh its current URL."
    },
    {
      "section": "Evaluation",
      "text": "The reproducible 30-case blinded A/B protocol, sanitized inputs, and independent evaluation are available in [tests/evaluation/report.md](tests/evaluation/report.md) and [tests/evaluation/conclusion.md](tests/evaluation/conclusion.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
